  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "🚀 v2.0.0 - Major API Simplification!\n      \n      🆕 New Features:\n      • CallWithFallback - Simple API with NO exceptions needed!\n      • isSuccess parameter - YOU define what success means\n      • Multiple fallbacks - Chain fallbacks that try in order\n      • IsHealthy property - Quick circuit health check\n      • Better namespace - using CircuitBreaker.Redis.Distributed\n      \n      ✨ All v1.0 Features Preserved:\n      • Distributed state via Redis\n      • Sliding window failure tracking\n      • Distributed locking (Redis SETNX)\n      • State machine (Closed/Open/HalfOpen/Isolated)\n      • Automatic fallback to in-memory\n      • Works with Azure, AWS, Redis Cloud, self-hosted\n      \n      🔄 Backward Compatible:\n      • Old Execute() API still works\n      • Old CircuitBreaker class still works\n      • Migrate at your own pace",
  "repository": "",
  "title": "Distributed Circuit Breaker for .NET using Redis",
